---
flowchart TB
  A["<b>Draft plan</b><br/>AI assistant calls plan_actions"] --> B["<b>Show proposed changes</b><br/>counts, scope, before / after"]
  B --> C["<b>Human approves</b><br/>in the side panel or the CLI<br/>aec-model-bridge-approve<br/>(never over MCP)"]
  C --> D["<b>Hub checks the plan matches</b><br/>same tool, same arguments, once only"]
  D --> E["<b>Revit runs each action</b><br/>in its own transaction"]
  E --> F["<b>Verify</b><br/>read the values back"]
  F --> G["<b>Undo with Ctrl+Z</b><br/>one press per action"]
  F --> H["<b>Or rollback_plan</b><br/>writes before-values back in reverse<br/>may skip actions with no before-value"]
  C -. "reject, or never approve" .-> X["<b>Blocked</b><br/>the model is untouched"]
  classDef human fill:#1CB5CA,stroke:#111923,color:#06222A
  classDef stop fill:#F59E0B,stroke:#92400E,color:#1F1300
  class C human
  class X stop
